  "_doc": "A steamwood prowler that hunts by hiding in the grotto fog. P1 \"In the Fog\": rakes and pounces on whoever is farthest; it breathes fog banks (pools that slow) to hide in. Two steam valves (levers, repeatable) blow the fog out of the room and catch it in the gust (short stun). P2 at 50% \"Scalded\": it rolls in a boiling spring and comes out steaming — burning pounce chains and a scalding shake.",
  "party": "Solo: blow the fog when it gets thick. 2-3: the farthest player gets pounced — let the tank be the farthest when possible. 5: spread for the chain.",
